  (text "J10/J11: parallel upstream Qwiic; R50 links their shared power to the local rail.\nJ12/J13: parallel five-pin deployment, including shared RESET_N.\nStandalone bench: disconnect the carrier/other host and supply. One host and one supply.\nPower links do not isolate SDA/SCL or separate external sources from each other.\nSet unique address DIP values with power OFF; configure upstream pulls for the complete bus." (at 15 29.21 0) (effects (font (size 1.0 1.0)) (justify left top)) (uuid "e26882c3-fb8e-5b91-bd73-15b5494569ee"))
